<title>USA: Greif Bros buys corrugated container co.</title>
<headline>Greif Bros buys corrugated container co.</headline>
<dateline>DELAWARE, Ohio 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greif Bros Corp said it has acquired Centralia Container Inc, a corrugated container company, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Centralia is based in Centralia, Ill.</p>
<p>Greif manufactures and markets industrial packaging and components including steel drums, fibre drums, plastic drums and multiwall bags.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
